{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fa7b958d-dc67-8c61-b5e2-cb420d2d8c7a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T10:31:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:27:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Denise. Yes, hi, this is Esteban Salazar. I'm on the speakerphone, I hope you can hear me okay, I've got my hands full out here. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. What can I help you with, Mr. Salazar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so, the bus stop. The one on my route, I manage a few buildings, and one of them sits right by a stop. The plow came through during the storm, the snow that turned to rain, you know, started Sunday and finished up this morning, and it pushed this giant wall of snow right across the stop. Right up over the curb. People can't get to the bus."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's the plow bank. It happens when they clear the road. Which street is the stop on, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:28:03-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's, um, by the corner of Broadway and, hold on, it's Broadway near Equality Park. The stop right in front of the little shop there. Used to be a fella there years ago, Sal, he'd shovel it himself before the first bus, every single morning, no matter what. Anyway. Sorry. Point is, it's buried."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Broadway by Equality Park, got it. So the snow's piled across the sidewalk and the stop area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, and now with the rain on top of it it's all heavy and slushy, and tonight it's going to freeze solid. So when is somebody going to clear it? That's what I want to know. Because I'm not out here with a shovel for the whole city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:28:57-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understandable. After a storm like this the crews finish the main plowing first, then they go back for the bus stops and the intersections. I'd say it's likely sometime today or tomorrow, depending on how the rest of the clean-up goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:29:15-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today or tomorrow. Okay. That's a big window, Denise, with respect. People are standing in the road right now, in the road, waiting for the bus. Which, you know, with the slush and the cars, it's not great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:29:32-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I agree, it's not safe. I'll put it in as a priority so they know people are stepping into the street. Can I get a callback number in case someone needs to confirm the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. It's four oh one, five five five, oh one five three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five three. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:30:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And Denise, I talk fast, and I wander, my wife says I could narrate a whole ballgame about a parking meter. So if I'm going too fast, you just tell me, okay? Don't be shy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine, I'm keeping up. I've got Broadway at Equality Park, bus stop buried by plow snow, request to clear it soon. Anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that it's the side facing the park, the one where the plow came by. The other side's mostly okay, a little slushy but you can step."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The park side, okay, I'll note that. The sidewalk there is part of what they'll be clearing, so I'll flag both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Good. I appreciate it. I just figured calling was better than grumbling at the windshield all morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, glad you did. I'll get this over to the crew supervisor right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks, Denise. Hopefully before that freeze tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:31:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll do what we can. Take care, Mr. Salazar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:31:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
